From b2afd46a9d4cd005dd13a1246dd01bd8ab2c8b64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "nano.wang" <nano.wang@quectel.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Jun 2025 10:29:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 4 SAPs creation

Support 4 SAPs, does not create NAN and P2P interface by default,
and can ONLY be used on modules that support DBS.
In addition, the following three configurations also need to be added
to the qcom_cfg.ini file,
gEnableNanSupport=1
gNumVdevs=5
gMaxConcurrentActiveSessions=4

---
